@ifinfo 
This manual currently combines Emacsvox operating guidance, generated
reference, and selected historical Emacspeak material.  Begin with Getting
Started, then continue to Speech Backends and Basic Usage.  Generated
reference and heritage are grouped separately after the current-user route;
heritage is preserved for background, not as current setup instructions.
For rapidly evolving Omnivox and Aural Presentation details, also consult
@file{Readme.org} and @file{etc/aural-presentation-reference.org} in the source
tree.

